<title>USA: FBL Financial Group Inc Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>FBL Financial Group Inc Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>WEST DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.93		    $0.76</p>
<p> Net			 37,934		   18,102</p>
<p> Revs		     140,803		  108,161</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,036		   23,854</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Share results give effect to 2,000-for-1 stock split before the company's initial public offering on July 19, 1996.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 pro forma adjusted operating income was $0.59 per share.  </p>
